    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira yaga inzi, Paolo, muhambe wa Kristo Yeso kulwa munyi vandu vizihiiri, saalaa ku Nyasaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Suuviraa ligali munyi mwamala kuhulira ndi, Nyasaye, mu zimbavasi zizie, yamalakuhaana ku inzi miyinzi yiji ngole kigira madanyi ginyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye yambulira lilohiza lilie liu mu vwivisu kandi nalikora limanyikane ku inzi. Mali kong'oda mu vwimbi amakuva yaga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi niiva mulasooma icha mali kong'oda, munyala kwiga nukumanya limanyiriza liange lia agaviswa ga Kristo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zing'inga ziavita, mundu siyavoolerwa amakuva gaviswa yaga mba, navuzwa Nyasaye umali kugavura kalunu ku Roho ku avatumwa na vaporofeti veve vatakatifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agaviswa gene ni yaga: kuvitira mu Ivangeri ya Nyasaye, vandu vizihiiri vagwiyi avasangi vi miandu harara na Avayuda mu zimbavasi zia Nyasaye; vave muviri mulala na vasaange mu lisuuvirizwa lia Nyasaye yalomba kuvitira mu Kristo Yeso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzi ndakorwa mutumikiri wi Ivangeri ku kihanwa kidukiru chi zimbavasi zia Nyasaye cha yamba kuvitira mu miyinzi ji zinguru zizie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kali nimbeeye mukekeeke ligali ku vandu va Nyasaye vosi, Nyasaye yamba zimbavasi zizie yizi, nduuki kwilwaazira vandu vizihiiri kigira uvutugi vwokogenyia vwa Kristo uvutanyala kwenyelerizwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ngole avandu vosi vaduuki kolola kuli lilohiza lia agaviswa ga Nyasaye liduukizwa. Nyasaye, oveeye mulombi wi vindu viosi yaavisa imbisu kutura kale, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kunangwa ku ing'inga ya lero, kuvitira munzira yi likanisa, zingelosi vamiihi, kandi vaveeye ni zinguru mwigulu vaduuki kwiga kuli Nyasaye aveeye mugeri mu liiva liosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasaye yakola yaga kolondekana nu vulaliri vwivwe uvutahera mba, vwa yanyoora kuvitira mu Kristo Yeso Mwami wiitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa, mu lihambanywa lietu na Kristo kandi kuvitira mu lisuuvira lietu muye, kunyi koveeye nuluviliraa kuzia imbiri wa Nyasaye vugira uvuti vwosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa mugoonyaa ligali, mutakuza mioyo mba kigira salira kulwa munyi; yaga gaveeye uvukala vwinyu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uvuyanzi vwa Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigira yaga, sigamaa mu lisaala imbiri wa Baba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oveeye uvutangiliru vwa vuli ihiiri yu mwigulu kandi ya haasi enyooraa lieta liayo liagiligali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inzi saalanga ku Nyasaye kutura ku vuhinda vwu vukumi vwivwe ahaane zinguru kumunyi kuvitira mu Roho weve, muduuki kuva nizinguru mu liiva lienyu liu mugati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saalanga ndi kandi Kristo aduuki kolomba vomenyo vwivwe mu mioyo jinyu kuvitira mu lisuuvira. Saalanga ndi vuyanzi vuduuki kuva musingi gwivindu viosi via mukoraa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kunangwa, munyi harara na vandu va Nyasaye vosi muduuki kuva nizinguru ziu kumanyiriza uvuyanzi vwa Kristo vutaveeye nekegero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yee, muduuki kumanya uvuyanzi vwa Kristo uvuvitaa limanya liosi, ndi muduuki kwizulwa ligali nu vuduukiru vwosi vwa Nyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kalunu uyu, wi zinguru zizie ziyinziraa mu kunyi, anyala kokora amanyingi ligali kuvita yago agakunyala koteeva anoho kuganaganaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uvukumi vove ku Nyasaye mu likanisa kandi mu Kristo Yeso, zing'inga ziosi, mihiga ni mihiga. Amini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Uvuhambani vwa Avakristayo mu Kristo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
